=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} to initiate the quest.
** You must wait one Earth minute after completing {q:Tuning In|Tuning In|Tuning In}.
* Speak with {n:Jakoh Wahcondalo} at (J-9) in Kazham.
* Speak with {p:Romaa Mihgo} at (H-11) in Kazham.
* Travel to {z:Yuhtunga Jungle} (K-7) in search of a ??? overlooking {p:Gemini Falls}.
** This side of the falls can be accessed from a tunnel in (I-7), you do not need to go through {z:Ifrit's Cauldron}.
** This cutscene will spawn 5 {m:Nasus} that you must defeat. The {m:Nasus} are easily killable by a level 75 job.
** Only one player can initiate and receive the quest cutscenes at the ???. Other players must wait 3 minutes after the defeat of the {m:Nasus} before being able to spawn their own NM and receive the the following cutscene.
* Click the ??? again after defeating the {m:Nasus}.
* Return to {z:Kazham} and speak with {p:Romaa Mihgo}.
* To progress further, you will need a {i:Mutton Tortilla|Mutton Tortilla|4506}, {i:Habaneros|Habaneros|1695}, and a serving of {i:Black Curry|Black Curry|4297}.
** {i:Habaneros|Habaneros|1695} can be bought from the {z:Auction House} ({@g:Auction House} > Food > Ingredients), bought from regional vendors, via Herb Seeds planted in your {p:Mog Garden}, or farmed from {m:Mantraps|Mantrap} in {z:Misareaux Coast}.
** {i:Black Curry|Black Curry|4297} can be bought from the {z:Auction House} ({@g:Auction House} > Food > Meals > Soups).
** {i:Mutton Tortilla|Mutton Tortilla|4506} can be bought from the {z:Auction House} ({@g:Auction House} > Food > Meals > Breads & Rice), or purchased from {n:Taajiji} at the Timbre Timbers Taverns in {z:Windurst Waters North|Windurst Waters} (If Windurst is at least 2nd place in Conquest).
* Head to {z:Norg} (K-8) to speak with {n:Comitolus} after getting your food items.
* Trade all three food items to {n:Comitolus} to receive the next cutscene. You will be told to head to {z:Beaucedine Glacier} and meet up with the {p:Rhinostery} researchers there.
* Head to {z:Beaucedine Glacier} (I-7) and speak with {n:Torino-Samarino} at the tower. The quest will be marked complete after this cutscene.
** {p:Survival Guide} and {p:Unity Warp} (Level 125) are the fastest options.
* Speaking to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} after completing the quest will reward you with a {i:Cache-nez|Cache-nez|15180}.

